# Local datasets only.  A bare `data/` also matched `src/kairos/data/`, so the
# entire data package -- dataset, loader, folds, transforms, taxonomy -- was
# silently untracked: a fresh clone could not even import kairos.  Anchor the
# pattern to the repository root.
/data/
*.pt
*.pth
*.parquet
